{"segment_id": "segment_00011", "start": 330.0, "end": 360.0, "speech": "趣或无趣呢？Have you ever felt embarrassed for the speaker? Why?你有没有因为说话者而感到尴尬？就是说，你替他感到尴尬，对吧？为啥？啊，为啥你会替他感到尴尬？OK，呃，那不多说了，加上作业。Ask Smith先写再朗读，这要写作，写完对答案。这要the story口语复述，呃，置顶留言找这个重复间隔的学习材料，对吧？那以上呢就是本期视频的全部", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000054.webp", "time": 337.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "Do you know any funny stories? Tell us", "one.", "Describe a wedding you have been to.", "What kind of speeches do you find", "boring/interesting? Have you ever felt'", "embarrassed' for the speaker? Why?"], "scores": [0.99773, 0.9938, 0.93526, 0.98624, 0.97742, 0.99139, 0.98664], "boxes": [[[57.0, 135.0], [560.0, 135.0], [560.0, 198.0], [57.0, 198.0]], [[185.0, 333.0], [1078.0, 331.0], [1078.0, 396.0], [185.0, 398.0]], [[193.0, 406.0], [310.0, 406.0], [310.0, 452.0], [193.0, 452.0]], [[189.0, 471.0], [1085.0, 475.0], [1085.0, 540.0], [189.0, 537.0]], [[189.0, 550.0], [998.0, 550.0], [998.0, 622.0], [189.0, 622.0]], [[190.0, 615.0], [1078.0, 613.0], [1078.0, 683.0], [190.0, 685.0]], [[190.0, 677.0], [1029.0, 679.0], [1029.0, 745.0], [190.0, 742.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000055.webp", "time": 342.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "Do you know any funny stories? Tell us", "one.", "Describe a wedding you have been to.", "What kind of speeches do you find", "boring/interesting? Have you ever felt'", "embarrassed' for the speaker? Why?"], "scores": [0.99718, 0.98805, 0.95009, 0.98667, 0.98362, 0.97814, 0.98616], "boxes": [[[56.0, 135.0], [560.0, 135.0], [560.0, 198.0], [56.0, 198.0]], [[186.0, 333.0], [1078.0, 331.0], [1078.0, 397.0], [186.0, 399.0]], [[193.0, 406.0], [310.0, 406.0], [310.0, 451.0], [193.0, 451.0]], [[190.0, 472.0], [1086.0, 476.0], [1086.0, 540.0], [190.0, 537.0]], [[189.0, 550.0], [998.0, 550.0], [998.0, 622.0], [189.0, 622.0]], [[190.0, 615.0], [1079.0, 613.0], [1079.0, 683.0], [190.0, 685.0]], [[190.0, 677.0], [1030.0, 679.0], [1030.0, 745.0], [190.0, 742.0]]]}